{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26086","headline":"夏日怀杜悰驸马 · 鲍溶","name":"夏日怀杜悰驸马","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"五月清凉萧史家，瑶池分水种菱花。\n回文地簟龙鳞浪，交鏁天窗蝉翼纱。\n闲遣青琴飞小雪，自看碧玉破甘瓜。\n仍闻圣主知书癖，凤阁烧香对五车。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鲍溶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26086.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26086","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}